WEBVTT

00:16:58.544 --> 00:17:01.999
didn't quite match what we expected.

00:17:01.999 --> 00:17:05.260
What's so exciting about the next decade of data

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:06.930
in astronomy is,

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.141
we don't even know how many answers

00:17:09.141 --> 00:17:10.941
are out there waiting,

00:17:10.941 --> 00:17:14.822
answers about our origins and our evolution.

00:17:14.822 --> 00:17:15.917
How many answers are out there

00:17:15.917 --> 00:17:19.211
that we don't even know the questions

00:17:19.211 --> 00:17:21.222
that we want to ask?

00:17:21.222 --> 00:17:23.169
Thank you.

00:17:23.169 --> 00:17:26.871
(Applause)